&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;People&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hub Coordinator&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Toast Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now, more than ever, the Toast team is committed to our customers. Our focus is on building the&lt;br&gt;restaurant platform that helps restaurants adapt, take control, and get back to what they do best: building&lt;br&gt;the businesses they love. And because our technology is purpose-built for restaurants, by restaurant&lt;br&gt;people, restaurants can trust that we’ll deliver on their needs for today while investing in experiences that&lt;br&gt;will power their restaurant of the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Toast is continuously growing and changing, and the People Operations team is at the center of it all,&lt;br&gt;supporting and enhancing the employee journey by evolving our processes and systems as we scale.&lt;br&gt;We meet Toasters in moments that matter. By enabling the business with tools and efficient processes,&lt;br&gt;we support all Toasters to thrive through providing a reliable and positive employee experience.&lt;br&gt;This roll* owns the execution of day-to-day activities to keep our people data accurate and up-to-date,&lt;br&gt;directly impacting the experience of employees or managers and ensuring that business runs smoothly.&lt;br&gt;An ideal candidate would be a great collaborator, have fierce organization, unparalleled attention to detail,&lt;br&gt;and strong communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an enthusiastic, organized, and detail-oriented person to join our People Operations&lt;br&gt;Team. The People Operations Specialist I is responsible for supporting the day-to-day operations, tasks&lt;br&gt;and projects supporting the People Team.&lt;br&gt;We offer a great opportunity to learn the full-cycle employee experience including onboarding, employee&lt;br&gt;record management, process improvement, system implementation, and off-boarding. The People&lt;br&gt;Operations Specialist I will be friendly and helpful, comfortable with handling highly confidential&lt;br&gt;information and will know how to prioritize work and understand the balancing act of managing multiple&lt;br&gt;projects simultaneously.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enter and maintain employee information into our HR System on a timely basis, accountable for&lt;br&gt;data integrity and keeping the strictest of confidentiality with sensitive employee information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate documentation &amp;amp;amp; completion of tasks in a timely manner within Workday, and assist&lt;br&gt;with additional reach outs in order to stay compliant with statutory regulations on documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Handle inbound employee inquiries via ServiceNow; identify needs, process necessary&lt;br&gt;transactions in our system of record, Workday and other HR systems, and escalate issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Proactively identify process improvements and collaborate towards a more productive process&lt;br&gt;that improves the customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with business partners to actively engage in the job requisition creation process in&lt;br&gt;Workday.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support new process development and refinement as Toast expands into new countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct audits and engage with customers to ensure compliance with various Toast programs,&lt;br&gt;such as required training, policy acknowledgements, and contractor record integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform other related duties or special projects as necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate in this role will be customer-oriented with strong organization skills, the ability to&lt;br&gt;manage multiple high priority tasks with tight deadlines, while maintaining impeccable attention to detail&lt;br&gt;and accuracy. Additional qualifications are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a HR department strongly preferred with 1-2 years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Workday, ServiceNow, or other HRIS systems is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;Excellent written and oral communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with confidential information and maintain discretion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s/Masters Degree in a Human Resources related field preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
