&lt;li&gt;Strong experience (6-8yrs) with React and its ecosystem&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Experience with Gatsby and its core concepts (e.g., static site generation, GraphQL).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Tailwind CSS and its utility-first approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate clearly and professionally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CMS Experience – having integrated website designs with a headless CMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of REST API usage best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building for multiple regions/languages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of web application security principles and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of git, and an understanding of code repository best practices&lt;/li&gt;
