&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a multinational or high-growth technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to SOX-compliant or US-listed organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience navigating and driving changes in a hybrid culture that balances startup agility with corporate structure (SaaS or tech industry experience is a major plus).&lt;/li&gt;
