&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Talent Acquisition Partner, you&#39;ll be a key part of our TA team, contributing to how we find and attract talent at Toast. You&#39;ll manage the full recruitment process, focusing on building strong candidate pools, making sure candidates have a great experience, and adapting to different hiring needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Toast&#39;s Talent Acquisition team prioritizes collaboration, expertise, and strong connections with our business partners. We&#39;re dedicated to finding the best candidates to support the growth of our company. If you&#39;re a recruiter with a passion for finding top talent and a proven track record of success in complex high volume recruiting, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Note&lt;/span&gt;: this is a fully remote, contract position.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life (Responsibilities)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver on recruiting goals and prioritize workload to meet deadlines and changing business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attract, recruit, and engage top talent for Toast’s GTM, predominately Sales, functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and prioritize the review of substantial inbound application volume using our Applicant Tracking System (ATS), identifying top-tier candidates quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exercise sound judgment and decision-making in all aspects of the recruitment process, balancing the needs of the business with candidate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skillfully navigate complex and ambiguous hiring scenarios, effectively partnering with hiring managers to clarify requirements, align expectations, and drive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with hiring managers through regular recruiting syncs, effective communication, and subject matter expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help deliver on key business needs by providing creative solutions and adapt recruitment strategies to address market conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver diverse pipelines and support inclusive recruitment processes by educating hiring managers and the business on inclusive hiring practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage data and key recruitment metrics to drive an efficient, equitable, and impactful search that ensures the right talent is matched with the right opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide exceptional customer service to both candidates and hiring managers, ensuring a positive and memorable experience throughout the recruitment process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share ideas, updates, and collaborate with cross-functional stakeholders.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of related experience with a Bachelor’s degree, or equivalent experience with a proven track record of recruiting across GTM functions, preferably Field Sales roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated depth and breadth of experience in high-volume recruiting, successfully partnering with hiring managers to fill roles across various GTM functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in leveraging recruitment data and metrics to impact hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, presentation, and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to communicate insights clearly and effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to work in fast-paced, ambiguous environments, with strong problem-solving skills and a proactive mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will help you stand out (Nonessential Skills/Nice to Haves):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Greenhouse as an ATS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience scheduling with GoodTime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience recruiting for sales talent at a SaaS company&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at Toast&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Toast, one of our company values is that we&#39;re hungry to build and learn. We believe learning new AI tools empowers us to build for our customers faster, more independently, and with higher quality. We provide these tools across all disciplines, from Engineering and Product to Sales and Support, and are inspired by how our Toasters are already driving real value with them. The people who thrive here are those who embrace changes that let us build more for our customers; it’s a core part of our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
