&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Software Engineer to join in building AI agents for Toast&#39;s Team area,&lt;/strong&gt; which is part of the Fintech line of business. The Team area is a mission-critical space on which our restaurants rely to manage their staff and optimize their labor. You&#39;ll play a key roll* in the design, development, and delivery of autonomous agents that transform how restaurant owners manage their workforce, blending cutting-edge AI with practical restaurant operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
