&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be hands-on in developing and shipping Team Agent products that leverage LLMs and agentic frameworks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flex your full-stack development muscles with challenging end-to-end tasks in a supportive, collaborative team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product managers, designers, and fellow engineers to build autonomous agents that transform restaurant workforce management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in designing, estimating, implementing, testing, and debugging end-to-end agent solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adopt and advocate for bleeding-edge spec-driven development and agentic development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor developers through code-pairing and detailed code, architecture, and project reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion best practices for agent development, deployment, and quality life cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively contribute to product design and feature selection discussions for the Team Agent space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in Java, Kotlin or other object oriented language(s)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with modern web standards and technologies (e.g. React, TypeScript, REST, GraphQL)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience or strong interest in using coding agents and adopting agentic development practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for building autonomous agents and working with LLMs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proven track record of building partnerships across engineering, product, customer success, and other stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and interest in mentoring peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience maintaining a high bar for quality, and guiding teams to hold a high bar for the technical quality of their deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer empathy and a drive to make their lives better through a thoughtful user experience, robust technical solutions, and continuous product improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Sauce* (Nonessential Ingredients)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing agentic products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building systems that leverage LLMs and other ML models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event-driven distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of workforce management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of restaurant operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is based in Ireland, and would require a candidate to be based in Ireland.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
