&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and development of the next generation of Toast’s software services and applications to bring a seamless device configuration and user experience for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product Management, Hardware, QA and other Software teams on the product roadmap and requirements to build a long term vision for Toast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create technical requirements and detailed designs of the software system being developed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead effort estimation sessions and use sound judgment to enable planning of projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose performance bottlenecks and implement optimizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make solid technical decisions keeping software quality, security, and maintainability in mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help set the standard for software quality by adopting modern software test frameworks and practices in day to day development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
