&lt;p&gt;Toast creates technology to help restaurants and local businesses succeed in a digital world, helping business owners operate, increase sales, engage customers, and keep employees happy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the&lt;strong&gt; Vice President of Enterprise Sales&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the strategy and execution of Toast’s most complex go-to-market (GTM) engine across Enterprise and Mid-Market divisions—spanning hotels, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, and global restaurant brands. A critical focus of this role is accelerating our expansion into the Quick-Service Restaurant (QSR) and drive-through segments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the Chief Operating Officer of Enterprise, you will leverage AI-driven insights and rigorous sales methodologies to transform our motion into a world-class, process-driven organization. You will bridge the gap between brand promise and operational delivery at massive scale, navigating multi-year C-suite negotiations with iconic global brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A day in the life (Responsibilities)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;C-Suite Engagement: &lt;/strong&gt;Build trusted, collaborative relationships with global enterprise executives, backed by a disciplined, repeatable sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM Strategy &amp;amp; Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct the go-to-market strategy for Toast&#39;s newest hardware and software solutions, positioning our platform as the partner of choice for high-volume, multi-unit brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Motion Modernization:&lt;/strong&gt; Audit and optimize current sales cycles to increase velocity, driving measurable operational efficiency and consistency across all enterprise segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-Powered Operations: &lt;/strong&gt;Introduce and scale predictive, machine-learning-powered forecasting tools to replace manual projections with data-validated insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Engineering Partnership: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaborate with Product and Engineering leadership to translate complex, enterprise-level partner requirements into a scalable, repeatable product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Representation:&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Toast across the enterprise sector, engaging at key industry forums and cultivating strategic partnerships to solidify our market leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll need to thrive (Requirements)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated track record leading high-performing enterprise GTM organizations capable of closing complex, large-scale annual contract value ($100M+ ACV) agreements with household-name brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to mature an organization&#39;s go-to-market approach—shifting from transactional, relationship-led efforts to structured, enterprise-level execution without losing operational momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Tech &amp;amp; AI Vision:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep expertise in modern sales tech stacks, with a clear vision for leveraging machine learning and data analytics in revenue operations and pipeline forecasting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Methodology Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level proficiency in enterprise sales methodologies and a history of implementing them to reduce friction in complex sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional ability to partner with Product and R&amp;amp;D teams to synthesize custom technical demands into platform features that win deals sustainably.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Agility:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to thrive in a fast-paced environment, balancing long-term strategic vision with the agile execution required to capture a rapidly evolving market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
