&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;*Bilingual Thai-speaking position. &lt;em&gt;This is a field sales opportunity that will require travel. Candidates must live local to the West Coast or be willing to relocate&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Toast creates technology to help restaurants and local businesses succeed in a digital world, helping business owners operate, increase sales, engage customers, and keep employees happy.&lt;/p&gt;
